message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Costantino
    given-names: Giuseppe
title: "trajmod: the simple non-linear GNSS time series trajectory model"
version: 2.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-28
url: "https://github.com/gcostantino/trajmod"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gcostantino/trajmod"
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - geodesy
  - trajectory modeling
  - postseismic relaxation
  - time series analysis
abstract: >
  A Python library for modeling GNSS displacement time series
  with advanced multi-tier postseismic filtering, supporting
  earthquake co-seismic offsets, postseismic relaxation, slow
  slip events, and event-type discrimination.
